Z||000000||ToddAsh||03-09-2001||06:06 PM||||Just thought this was odd. Purchased a '85 Fiero,stored last 15 years, loaded but has factory AM radio.Is this rare? I already changed it to a stereo,selling AM to someone just curious if this was an unusual option.Feel kind of bad changing anything on this car bit I want to use it.Only has 15,000 miles. I put on 16" wheels & tires,a wing and a new stereo and speakers. I guess this would be worth more left original but I don't think I'd ever sell it.Went through a couple of Corvette restorations but I'm new to Fieros. Really great little cars.Learning a lot here. Thanks Everyone.Todd Ash||||reg||1
