Z||000003||Veronica's V6 GT||03-10-2001||08:12 PM||||You wondered if my car was the one you missed by a half hour last november, a white 88 GT. It may have been, I got mine in Newark DE though.  The guy said he had alot of calls from all over the US. Someone tried to buy it out from under me but the guy stuck to his word, plus I handed him cash quickly. I hope you enjoy your Fiero as much as I do mine.  They are great looking cars and fun to drive.  I love the way they take a turn, no brakes needed. I've sort adopted the same theory as a friend of mine that "driving is a sport".  ||||reg||1
